{"sourceUrl":"https://mksxy.usst.edu.cn/2025/0616/c2750a343353/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:24.238700+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mksxy.usst.edu.cn/2025/0616/c2750a343353/page.htm","html":"<div><div><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p><p><span><span>上海理工大学马克思主义学院是上海市示范马克思主义学院和上海市特色马克思主义学院。</span><span><span>学院师资力量雄厚，其中多名教师荣获全国高校思想政治理论教师影响力提名人物、上海市高校思想政治理论课中青年拔尖人才、上海市社科新人、上海市曙光学者、上海市晨光学者、上海市阳光学者、上海市最美思政课教师等荣誉称号。近年来，学院教师成功申报国家社科基金</span><span>10</span><span>余项，省部项目</span><span>30</span><span>余项，发表</span><span>CSSCI</span><span>论文</span><span>90</span><span>余篇，出版专著</span><span>30</span><span>余本，科研水平居同类高校前列。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院拥有</span><span><span>马克思主义理论一级学科硕士点，学科特色突出，下设马克思主义中国化与新时代上海发展研究中心、西方马克思主义与中国马克思主义比较研究中心、马克思主义科学方法论与现代科技发展研究所、中国近现代国情研究所、政治与法治教育研究所、</span><span>上海理工大学中国共产党伟大建党精神研究中心</span><span>等学术研究机构。学院按照马克思主义理论一级学科招生，研究方向包括马克思主义基本原理、马克思主义中国化、思想政治教育、国外马克思主义研究、中国近现代史基本问题研究，每年招收硕士研究生</span><span>30</span><span>人左右。</span></span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>夏令营招生简章</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）招生对象：获得推免资格和第一志愿报考我校</span><span>2026</span><span>年马克思主义理论硕士研究生的优秀大学生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）招生规模：</span><span>60</span><span>人</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）活动方式：采取线上方式参加，腾讯会议号另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）联系邮箱：</span></span><span>marxusst@163.com</span><span><span>   </span></span></p><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）基本条件：政治立场坚定，拥护党的领导，身体健康，无任何违法违纪处分；应届本科三年级在校本科生（</span><span>2026</span><span>届本科毕业生）及品学兼优的往届学生；外语语种限英语且通过</span><span>CET-4</span><span>考试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）优先条件：具有下列条件的优先入选：本科毕业学校为原</span><span>985</span><span>、</span><span>211</span><span>或双一流高校；本科专业为马克思主义理论、马克思主义哲学、政治学、社会学、经济学、历史学等相关专业；本科期间获得过国家奖学金、校级一等奖学金等相关奖励；本科期间参加过省部级及以上相关竞赛并获奖；本科期间在正式刊物上公开发表论文及其他相关成果（作品）。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong><strong><span>报名方式及时间</span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）报名时间：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日</span><span>- 6</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）报名步骤：提交材料→材料审核→入选公示</span></span></p><p><span><span>提交材料：凡有意报名参加我院夏令营活动的同学请于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日前将《全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》及相关佐证材料（扫描</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式）压缩后以附件形式发送至</span></span><span>marxusst@163.com</span><span><span>。邮件主题：“张三</span><span>+</span><span>所在学校”（如“张三</span><span>+</span><span>上海理工大学”）。报名材料包括：</span><span>a.</span><span>《全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》（附件</span><span>1</span><span>）；</span><span>b.</span><span>身份证正反面扫描件（</span><span>PDF</span><span>）；</span><span>c.</span><span>在校成绩单扫描件（教务处盖章，</span><span>PDF</span><span>）；</span><span>d.</span><span>外语等级证书扫描件（如</span><span>CET4</span><span>、</span><span>CET6</span><span>成绩单等，</span><span>PDF</span><span>）；</span><span>e.</span><span>其他证明材料（如各类获奖证书、荣誉证书、已发表论文等</span><span>PDF</span><span>扫描文件）。逾期提交材料者不予受理。</span></span></p><p><span><span>材料审核：学院将对提交的材料进行审核，遴选出符合条件的营员。请务必保证提交信息和材料真实准确，如有不实一经发现将直接取消参营资格。</span><span> </span><span>入选公示：符合报名条件且通过材料审核的学生名单将在上海理工大学马克思主义学院官网公示。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong><strong><span>入营时间、人数</span></strong></p><p><span><span>  </span></span><span><span>夏令营举办时间为</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日，招生计划为</span><span>60</span><span>名。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>5. </span></strong><strong><span>夏令营活动安排</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span></span></strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><p><a href=\"https://mksxy.usst.edu.cn/2025/0616/c2750a343353/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://mksxy.usst.edu.cn/2025/0616/c2750a343353/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>（一）线上报到</span></span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>时间</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>地点</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>负责人</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>月<span>28</span>日</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>（腾讯会议号）另行通知</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>邢中先</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><p><span><span><span>（二）夏令营活动安排</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>28</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>活动内容</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>主持人</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>9:00-9:30</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>开营式、学校相关情况介绍</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>牛海（马克思主义学院副院长）</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>9:30-10:00</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>学院学科介绍</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>金瑶梅（马克思主义学院院长）</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>10:00-11:30</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mksxy.usst.edu.cn/2025/0616/c2750a343353/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://mksxy.usst.edu.cn/2025/0616/c2750a343353/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>马克思主义学术前沿讲座：</span></span></a></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>阅读经典 理解生活<span>—</span>谈谈马克思学说</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>的当代性</span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>梁豪 马克思主义学院 硕士生导师</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>13:30-15:00</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>马克思主义学术前沿讲座：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>焦虑与<span>HI</span>灵性：<span>AI</span>时代人类生存境遇的哲学解读</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>李梅敬 马克思主义学院 硕士生导师</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>15:00-16:00</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>优秀研究生代表交流</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>吴军（马克思主义学院党委副书记）</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>16:00-16:30</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>结业式</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>李杰（马克思主义学院党委书记）</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span></span></strong><br/></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mksxy.usst.edu.cn/_ue